#: ../../Operation/Coagulant_Automation.rst:177
msgid ""
"A possible solution method is to use a running approximation for the "
"exponential term based on the previous measurement of  "
":math:`C_{TS_{flocculated}}`."
msgstr ""
"Un posible método de solución es usar una aproximación ejecutiva para el "
"término exponencial basada en la medición previa de  "
":math:`C_{TS_{flocculated}}`."

#: ../../Operation/Coagulant_Automation.rst:179
msgid ""
"C_{TS_{flocculated_{t + \\theta}}} = C_{TS_{flocFiltered_{t + \\theta}}}  "
"e^\\frac{C_{raw_{t - \\theta}} - C_{TS_{flocculated_{t}}}}{C_{Cleared}}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Operation/Coagulant_Automation.rst:184
msgid ""
"The value of :math:`C_{TS_{flocFiltered_{t + \\theta}}}` is the target "
"performance for the water leaving the conventional sedimentation tank. At "
"each time step first use Equation :eq:`C_TS_flocculated_of_flocFiltered` to "
"obtain an estimate of the target for the turbidity after flocculation and a "
"tube settler, :math:`C_{TS_{flocculated_{t + \\theta}}}`. The result from "
"Equation :eq:`C_TS_flocculated_of_flocFiltered` can then be substituted into"
" Equation :eq:`CcoagplantofDOM` to calculate the new coagulant dose."
msgstr ""
"El valor de :math:`C_{TS_{flocFiltered_{t + \\theta}}}` es el rendimiento "
"objetivo del agua que sale del tanque convencional de sedimentación. En cada"
" paso de tiempo, primero se utiliza la Ecuación "
":eq:`C_TS_flocculated_of_flocFiltered` para obtener una estimación del "
"objetivo para la turbidez tras la floculación y un sedimentador tubular, "
":math:`C_{TS_{flocculated_{t + \\theta}}}`. El resultado de la Ecuación "
":eq:`C_TS_flocculated_of_flocFiltered` puede sustituirse en la Ecuación "
":eq:`CcoagplantofDOM` para calcular la nueva dosis de coagulante."

#: ../../Operation/Coagulant_Automation.rst:186
msgid ""
"Still need to figure out the correction method for Need to think carefully "
"about the time for measurement of each of these parameters and the various "
":math:`\\theta` involved."
msgstr ""
"Todavía hay que averiguar el método de corrección para Need y pensar "
"cuidadosamente en el tiempo de medición de cada uno de estos parámetros y en"
" las distintas :math:`\\theta` implicadas."

#: ../../Operation/Coagulant_Automation.rst:190
msgid ""
"C_{TS_{flocculated}} = C_{TS_{flocFiltered}}  e^\\frac{C_{raw} - "
"C_{TS_{flocculated}}}{C_{Cleared}}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../Operation/Coagulant_Automation.rst:195
msgid ""
"Unfortunately this can't be solved for :math:`C_{TS_{flocculated}}`, but we "
"can solve for the settled water turbidity, :math:`C_{TS_{flocFiltered}}`. We"
" invert the fraction and put a negative sign in the exponent."
msgstr ""
"Desafortunadamente, esto no puede resolverse para "
":math:`C_{TS_{flocculated}}`, pero sí podemos resolver para la agua "
"sedimentada turbidez, :math:`C_{TS_{flocFiltered}}`. Invertimos la fracción "
"y ponemos un signo negativo en el exponente."

#: ../../Operation/Coagulant_Automation.rst:197
msgid ""
"C_{TS_{flocFiltered}} =  C_{TS_{flocculated}} e^\\frac{C_{TS_{flocculated}} "
"- C_{raw}}{C_{Cleared}}"
msgstr ""

